  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "公司有间谍！  (There Is a Spy at the Company!)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Passing down a quiet corridor, Bu Xiaogu overhears Ji Xiu talking on the phone about taking down Chun Yuqiao. Alarmed, Xiaogu tells Qin Xiao — who warns her to stay out of office politics. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "星天也在用我们提供的数据。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我们公司是最专业的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "最想搞掉的就是那个淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司有间谍！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才听见她打电话了，她要出卖淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你听错了吧，你别多管闲事啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我也不能不管吧，这怎么办啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们的艺人方案特别重要，不能泄露！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "职场里边很复杂，你听我的，先顾自己。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what Xiaogu overhears and how Qin Xiao reacts.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "星天也在用我们提供的数据。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian is also using the data we provide.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我们公司是最专业的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our company is the most professional.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "最想搞掉的就是那个淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The one you want to take down most is that Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司有间谍！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a spy in the company!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才听见她打电话了，她要出卖淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just heard her making a phone call — she is going to betray Director Chun Yu!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你听错了吧，你别多管闲事啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You must have misheard; do not go meddling in other people's business.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我也不能不管吧，这怎么办啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I cannot just ignore it either — what should I do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们的艺人方案特别重要，不能泄露！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our guest-artist plan is especially important; it must not leak!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "职场里边很复杂，你听我的，先顾自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Inside the workplace things are complicated; listen to me and look after yourself first.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "星天也在用我们提供的数据。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我们公司是最专业的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "最想搞掉的就是那个淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司有间谍！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚才听见她打电话了，她要出卖淳于总！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你听错了吧，你别多管闲事啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我也不能不管吧，这怎么办啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们的艺人方案特别重要，不能泄露！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "职场里边很复杂，你听我的，先顾自己。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Ignoring Qin Xiao's caution, Xiaogu decides she has to warn Chun Yuqiao in person. You learned \"da dianhua\" for making a call, \"tingcuo\" for mishearing, and \"zenme ban\" for \"what should I do?\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
